# ---- Keep the published WebGL build in docs/ ----
# The rules above ignore any root-level Build/ folder, but docs/Build is the
# site served by GitHub Pages, so it stays tracked.
!docs/Build/
!docs/Build/**

# ---- TextMesh Pro bundled samples ----
# Unity's own demo scenes and scripts. Not used by the game, and keeping them
# out means the repo's language stats reflect code that is actually mine.
Assets/TextMesh Pro/Examples & Extras/
Assets/TextMesh Pro/Examples & Extras.meta
